00:37:41.600 --> 00:37:44.840
definition of that. If the bacterial

00:37:43.200 --> 00:37:47.000
test results have been communicated to

00:37:44.840 --> 00:37:48.560
me as soon as possible immediately or if

00:37:47.000 --> 00:37:50.960
my surgeon's medical team had said,

00:37:48.560 --> 00:37:52.280
"Hey, maybe go to get a bacterial swab

00:37:50.960 --> 00:37:54.280
